divergence: Ipe.Core.Jwt flat kernels (encodeRs256/decodeRs256) are the Rust-backend M5b interim surface; the Go backend exposes only the builder API (Jwt.encode / rs256 / decode), so this exact program does not compile on the Go reference. Token bytes remain byte-identical to Go (see tests/golden/jwt_rs256_bytes). Ipe records its own output. Divergence from Ipe, rationale: JWT API-surface interim (docs/architecture/divergence-policy.md).
